{"seq":2,"slug":"strategic-philosophy","title":"战略思想","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/sun-tzu/core-contributions/strategic-philosophy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"winning-without-fighting","title":"不战而屈人之兵","url":"/c/people/sun-tzu/core-contributions/strategic-philosophy/winning-without-fighting","wordCount":1611,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"knowing-self-and-enemy","title":"知己知彼","url":"/c/people/sun-tzu/core-contributions/strategic-philosophy/knowing-self-and-enemy","wordCount":1694,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 战略思想\n\n本章呈现孙子深刻的战略思想。\"不战而屈人之兵\"，体现了孙子的全胜追求；\"知己知彼，百战不殆\"，则揭示了认知在战争中的决定作用。两篇文档，分别呈现不战而屈人之兵的全胜思想，以及知己知彼的认知思想。\n"}